SUMMARY:🍂 Crothers Woods Fall Hike & Ice Cream Treat! 🍦
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\n## 🍂 **Crothers Woods Fall Hike
  & Ice Cream Treat!** 🍦\n\nToronto doesn’t have many true hiking trai
 ls — but Crothers Woods is one of the best! This beautiful wooded trail 
 is especially stunning in the fall\, with the leaves turning every shade o
 f red and gold.\nWe’ll start by walking along **Broadview Avenue to Pott
 ery Road**\, heading down the hill to meet the **Don Valley Trail**. From 
 there\, we’ll join the **Crothers Woods Trail**\, take in the fall colou
 rs\, stop for a short break\, and then walk back.\n\nThere are a few light
  hills — and one big one at the very end (Pottery Road\, I’m looking a
 t you!) — but don’t worry\, there’s a sweet reward waiting. After al
 l that hard work\, we’ll stop for **Dairy Queen ice cream**!\nThis hike 
 is a bit more challenging than some of our regular walks\, but totally wor
 th it for the views (and the ice cream).\n\n**This event happens rain or s
 hine!**\n\n***\n\n### 📍 **Meetup Details**\n\n**Meeting Spot:** Right o
 utside **Broadview Subway Station** — I’ll be the one wearing the **Mo
 ose Hat!** 🦌\n**Ending Spot:** Broadview Subway Station\n**Meetup Fee:*
 * $5 (cash in person or e-transfer to **mathewmaclean@hotmail.com**)\n\n**
 *\n\n### 🕒 **Timing**\n\n11:00am and I will only wait 5mins — the hik
 e should take about **2 hours**.\nYou can leave anytime you like if you ne
 ed to head back early.\n\n***\n\n### 🥾 **What to Bring**\n\n* Water\n* 
 Good walking or hiking shoes\n* A snack\n* A positive attitude (and maybe 
 room for ice cream!)\n\n***\n\n### ⚠️ **A Quick Note**\n\nSometimes th
 ings come up and I might need to cancel or reschedule. Please keep an eye 
 on the event page for updates.\n\n***\n\n### 👋 **About This Group**\n\n
 This group is open to **everyone** — whether you’re single or not\, ne
 w to the city\, or just looking to be social and make friends.\nWe also ho
 st **movies\, walks\, hikes\, arts & culture events\, and restaurant outin
 gs**!\nYou can RSVP ahead of time **or just show up** if you’re not sure
  you can make it — we’re flexible like that.\n\n***\n\n**Organizer:** 
 Mathew\n📧 Email: **torontomoviesandoutings@hotmail.com**
