SUMMARY:TNT Pub Night+AI Tools To Save You Time (Short Talk) - Fri\, Nov 1
 3 @ 7:30 pm
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nOur pub nights are always popular.
  We had a blast at Pauper's Pub in the past\, so we're heading there once 
 again. Come out and enjoy a drink\, get to meet other TNT members and have
  a lot of fun!\n\nWe are starting at 7:30 p.m.\, but you can arrive or lea
 ve whenever you like.\n\nHow to get to Pauper's Pub\n\nBy TTC: Get off at 
 Bathurst subway station on the Bloor-Danforth (green) line. Walk a few blo
 cks east on Bloor Street West and you'll see the pub.\n\nCurious about AI 
 but not sure where to start\, or tried a tool once and didn’t know what 
 to do next? In this relaxed walkthrough\, I’ll show how small business o
 wners and freelancers can use AI to save time on everyday work like writin
 g\, marketing\, and admin. You’ll see a live demo with Claude and a few 
 prompts you can copy and try the next day. No jargon\, no tech background 
 needed. Ask questions as we go\, then we’ll get back to the pints and co
 nversation. I'll probably start the talk around 8 p.m.\n\nBy car : Pauper'
 s Pub is located just east of Bathurst/Bloor. If you are driving\, there a
 re a few Green P Parking lots\, as well as on street parking\, which may b
 e harder to get.\n\nWhere We'll Meet: When you get to Pauper's Pub\,There 
 will be a TorontoTNT Meetup sign to let you know which floor it is.\n\nIf 
 you get lost or need directions\, you can text me at (647)-995-9218.\n\nPr
 icing & Costs\n\nNo costs or cover! Pay for our own food and drinks.\n\nA 
 small $5 donation to pay for the Meetup fees would be appreciated\, but no
 t necessary.
